people who want money.

00:46:48.290 --> 00:46:50.420
There's plenty people
who want a bigger title,

00:46:50.420 --> 00:46:54.520
work, life balance, travel,
I actually don't care.

00:46:54.520 --> 00:46:56.730
I just need to know what they are.

00:46:56.730 --> 00:46:58.730
If you're unbelievable,
you can have 'em all.

00:46:58.730 --> 00:47:01.470
If you kinda suck, you're
gonna have to pick one.

00:47:01.470 --> 00:47:03.080
But the reality is is

00:47:03.080 --> 00:47:05.730
I need to put them in a
position to tell me what it is,

00:47:05.730 --> 00:47:09.970
and I'm quadrupling down on
the context with my employees.

00:47:09.970 --> 00:47:12.730
Way too many of us spend
way too much energy

00:47:12.730 --> 00:47:17.560
on customers and nowhere
close to enough on employees.

00:47:17.560 --> 00:47:19.420
And I promise you, if you reverse that,

00:47:19.420 --> 00:47:22.530
your organizations will
feel the financial impact

00:47:22.530 --> 00:47:24.173
in a very significant way.

00:47:26.502 --> 00:47:28.950
Gentleman who introduced
me said something to me,

00:47:28.950 --> 00:47:31.770
today, this morning in
Brisbane I said, you know,

00:47:31.770 --> 00:47:33.290
everything I'm trying to do here

00:47:33.290 --> 00:47:35.130
is predicated on trying to figure out

00:47:35.130 --> 00:47:37.093
what people are saying behind my back.

00:47:38.420 --> 00:47:40.147
And he said to me that,

00:47:40.147 --> 00:47:42.267
"You know, it's a real pleasure
to have you here, Gary.

00:47:42.267 --> 00:47:44.187
"I've gotta tell you, it's
interesting, I do this a lot,

00:47:44.187 --> 00:47:46.717
"you do this a lot, it's super interesting

00:47:46.717 --> 00:47:51.717
"how people talk about you
back here in the set up room

00:47:51.797 --> 00:47:54.097
"and how many nice things
are said about you."

00:47:55.100 --> 00:47:57.313
My friends, everybody's watching.

00:47:58.580 --> 00:48:02.270
And now with technology,
everybody's watching for real.

00:48:02.270 --> 00:48:05.900
Every word, every tweet,
every Facebook thing you say,

00:48:05.900 --> 00:48:07.580
is something that you're gonna

00:48:07.580 --> 00:48:09.110
have to explain to your grandchild.

00:48:09.110 --> 00:48:13.280
Everything you sell, how you
sell it, how you interact.

00:48:13.280 --> 00:48:16.230
I implore you, listen, it's one thing

00:48:16.230 --> 00:48:18.390
