00:48:26.310 --> 00:48:28.920
and they get upset and
they say I'm a blowhard.

00:48:28.920 --> 00:48:30.670
Makes sense.

00:48:30.670 --> 00:48:33.130
But the people that
actually interact with you,

00:48:33.130 --> 00:48:34.470
who spend time with you,

00:48:34.470 --> 00:48:37.031
