them to say the right thing.

00:48:40.410 --> 00:48:43.090
The only way you can do that,
actually, in my opinion,

00:48:43.090 --> 00:48:45.683
is to have very longterm vision.

00:48:46.740 --> 00:48:49.310
So many people here wanna
it to happen tomorrow.

00:48:49.310 --> 00:48:52.793
And they're gonna live
for another 77 years.

00:48:53.690 --> 00:48:56.634
So many of you are
taking shortcuts to make

00:48:56.634 --> 00:48:58.040
