money for the next 44 years.

00:49:03.330 --> 00:49:06.840
We are stunningly intriguing animals

00:49:06.840 --> 00:49:09.280
with our inability to be patient.

00:49:09.280 --> 00:49:13.010
With our desperate need to get
something in the short term

00:49:13.010 --> 00:49:15.880
